VII. DECISION
1. To  find  the  instant  petition  inadmissible  in  relation  to  Article  46.1.a  of  the  American Convention;
2. To notify the parties of this decision;
3. To publish this decision and include it in its Annual Report to the General Assembly of the Organization of American States.
